<p style="text-align: left;">Communication Studies focuses on verbal and nonverbal communications, critical thinking and research, concentrating on the ways humans interact with one another, and how this affects the world around them. Students will develop strong interpersonal and critical thinking skills as well as excellent written and verbal communication skills.<br /><br /></p>
